ridges or  expand the size of the tent yeah even  two days before the election the smell  was in the air not just in georgia but  all over the country yeah that's a  definite red flag no no question no  question there the book is gop 2.0 how  the 2020 election can lead to a better  way forward for america's conservative  party we've been speaking with the  book's author jeff duncan who's the  lieutenant governor of georgia really  appreciate your time and your  perspective today  yeah thanks for the opportunity i really  i really appreciate
 

